            "notes": "First round I typically go for a standard AP load out, the goal of the round is to just farm and get enough money to not die and get a feel for the enemy team.\n\nI pick  [Launch Vector](item_7d4ef8eb-a008-4f63-802d-a67bd9d6989e)  as this is core of the build. There is no reason to go anything else.\n\nI have recently started going  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) instead of [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) I found barrage was taking awhile to farm in the early stages.",
